WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.754
When a test goes green,

2
00:00:01.754 --> 00:00:05.520
there can still be a review comment
waiting on the pull request.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.673
Using a sample pull request, Watch PR
checks the current commit and its reviews.

4
00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:17.880
The test passed, but a comment in the
command line file still needs a response.

5
00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:30.455
The report names the commit,
check results, and open threads.

6
00:00:30.455 --> 00:00:33.807
You can see what needs
attention before you merge.
